# Smart Task Manager (Python)

A command-line based task management system built using Python. This project is being developed step-by-step to demonstrate backend logic and system design.

---

## 🚀 Features

### ✅ Day 1
- Add Task
- View Tasks

### ✅ Day 2
- Mark Task as Complete
- Delete Task

### ✅ Day 3
- Task priority (High/Medium/Low)

### ✅ Day 4
- Deadline tracking for tasks

### ✅ Day 5
- Sorting tasks based on priority

---

## 🛠 Tech Stack
- Python
- CLI (Command Line Interface)

---

# Smart Task Manager (Python)

A command-line based task management system built using Python. This project demonstrates backend development concepts, task handling logic, and persistent storage using JSON.

---

## 🚀 Features

- Add, view, update, and delete tasks (CRUD operations)
- Mark tasks as completed
- Assign priority levels (High / Medium / Low)
- Deadline tracking for tasks
- Sort tasks based on priority
- Persistent storage using JSON (tasks are saved across sessions)

---
## 🌐 Web Version (Flask)

This project also includes a web-based version built using Flask, allowing users to manage tasks through a browser interface.

Features:
- Add tasks using form
- View tasks in browser
- Mark complete and delete tasks

